{"id": "2f83f47b-5d69-4e31-9e01-7ec8c7999da0", "slug": "platform-features-4", "title": "Platform Features", "description": "Platform Features Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Platform Features\"\ndescription: \"Platform Features Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#F97316\"\n  secondary: \"#000000\"\n  accent: \"#3B82F6\"\n  background: \"#F8F9FA\"\n  surface: \"#191C21\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#E5E7EB\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"20px\"\n  control: \"20px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Platform Features\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Sourasith Phomhome (@madebysourasith). Views: 92; favorites: 12; remixes: 1.\nTags: feature, section, animated, bento.\n## Overview\nPlatform Features Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nNexus Platform Features Explore: Integrations Changelog Pricing Log in Start Building Universal Compatibility Integrates seamlessly with every application on your device, from simple text editors to complex IDEs. Instan…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Platform Features; Universal Compatibility; Ultra-Low Latency; Meeting Notes: Project Alpha; Smart Structuring; Custom Vocabulary.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #F97316, secondary #000000, accent #3B82F6, background #F8F9FA, surface #191C21, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Platform Features</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#F8F9FA] min-h-screen flex flex-col p-4 md:p-8 lg:p-12\" style=\"font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\">\n\n    <!-- Adapted Header Section -->\n    <header class=\"w-full max-w-[1200px] mx-auto mb-10 mt-4 flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between gap-8 border-b border-gray-200/60 pb-8\">\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-5\">\n            <!-- Brand -->\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-tr from-blue-600 to-blue-400 flex items-center justify-center text-white shadow-[0px_2px_3px_-1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1),0px_1px_0px_0px_rgba(25,28,33,0.02),0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(25,28,33,0.08)]\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:box-minimalistic-linear\" width=\"22\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n                <span class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 tracking-tight\">Nexus</span>\n            </div>\n            \n            <!-- Section Context -->\n            <div>\n                <h1 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mb-3\">Platform Features</h1>\n                <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-2 text-[0.875rem]\">\n                    <span class=\"text-gray-500 font-medium\">Explore:</span>\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-900 font-medium transition-colors\">Integrations</a>\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-900 font-medium transition-colors\">Changelog</a>\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-900 font-medium transition-colors\">Pricing</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Actions -->\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-5\">\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-[0.875rem] font-medium text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-900 transition-colors\">Log in</a>\n            \n            <!-- Button with Gradient Border & Beautiful Shadows -->\n            <div class=\"rounded-full bg-gradient-to-b from-blue-400 to-blue-600 p-[1px] shadow-[0px_2px_3px_-1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1),0px_1px_0px_0px_rgba(25,28,33,0.02),0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(25,28,33,0.08)] hover:shadow-[0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_1px_1px_-0.5px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_3px_3px_-1.5px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),_0px_6px_6px_-3px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_12px_12px_-6px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_24px_24px_-12px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06)] transition-shadow duration-300\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"block bg-gradient-to-b from-blue-500 to-blue-600 hover:from-blue-400 hover:to-blue-500 text-white text-[0.875rem] font-medium px-5 py-2 rounded-full transition-all\">\n                    Start Building\n                </a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <!-- Main Content Wrapper (Preserves centering for original grid) -->\n    <main class=\"flex-1 flex items-center justify-center w-full\">\n        <!-- Original Grid Container -->\n        <div class=\"max-w-[1200px] w-full mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\">\n\n            <!-- Card 1: Universal Integration -->\n            <div class=\"bg-white rounded-3xl p-1.5 shadow-[0_4px_24px_rgba(0,0,0,0.03)] border border-gray-100/60 flex flex-col group hover:shadow-[0_8px_32px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06)] transition-shadow duration-500\">\n                <!-- Illustration Area -->\n                <div class=\"h-[260px] bg-gradient-to-b from-blue-50/30 to-transparent rounded-[20px] relative flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden\">\n                    <!-- Decorative faint circles -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute w-48 h-48 rounded-full border border-blue-100/50\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute w-64 h-64 rounded-full border border-blue-50/50\"></div>\n                    \n                    <!-- Rotating Orbit System -->\n                    <div id=\"orbit-ring\" class=\"absolute w-40 h-40 rounded-full border border-blue-200/40 border-dashed flex items-center justify-center\">\n                        <div class=\"absolute -top-3 -left-1 bg-white p-1.5 rounded-full shadow-sm border border-gray-50 orbit-icon text-blue-500 flex items-center justify-center\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:laptop-minimalistic-linear\" width=\"14\"></iconify-icon></div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute top-8 -right-3 bg-white p-1.5 rounded-full shadow-sm border border-gray-50 orbit-icon text-blue-500 flex items-center justify-center\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:code-linear\" width=\"14\"></iconify-icon></div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute -bottom-2 right-4 bg-white p-1.5 rounded-full shadow-sm border border-gray-50 orbit-icon text-blue-500 flex items-center justify-center\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:chat-round-line-linear\" width=\"14\"></iconify-icon></div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute bottom-6 -left-3 bg-white p-1.5 rounded-full shadow-sm border border-gray-50 orbit-icon text-blue-500 flex items-center justify-center\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:folder-with-files-linear\" width=\"14\"></iconify-icon></div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Central Hub -->\n                    <div class=\"relative w-16 h-16 bg-gradient-to-tr from-blue-500 to-blue-400 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(59,130,246,0.4)] z-10\">\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-white/20 rounded-full animate-ping\" style=\"animation-duration: 3s;\"></div>\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:microphone-2-linear\" width=\"28\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <!-- Text Area -->\n                <div class=\"px-5 pt-4 pb-6 flex-1\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-[1.125rem] font-medium text-gray-900 tracking-tight mb-2\">Universal Compatibility</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-[0.875rem] font-light text-gray-500 leading-[1.6]\">Integrates seamlessly with every application on your device, from simple text editors to complex IDEs.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Card 2: Ultra-Low Latency -->\n            <div class=\"bg-white rounded-3xl p-1.5 shadow-[0_4px_24px_rgba(0,0,0,0.03)] border border-gray-100/60 flex flex-col group hover:shadow-[0_8px_32px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06)] transition-shadow duration-500\">\n                <div class=\"h-[260px] bg-gradient-to-b from-emerald-50/30 to-transparent rounded-[20px] relative flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden\">\n                    \n                    <!-- Floating Tags -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-6 flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-sm px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full shadow-[0_2px_8px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)] border border-emerald-100/50\" style=\"transform: translateY(0px);\" id=\"float-tag-1\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:bolt-linear\" width=\"12\" class=\"text-emerald-500\"></iconify-icon>\n                        <span class=\"text-[0.65rem] font-medium text-emerald-600 uppercase tracking-wider\">Instant Processing</span>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"absolute bottom-8 left-10 flex items-center gap-2 bg-white px-3 py-2 rounded-xl shadow-[0_4px_12px_rgba(0,0,0,0.05)] border border-gray-50\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:clock-circle-linear\" width=\"16\" class=\"text-emerald-500\"></iconify-icon>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-baseline gap-0.5\">\n                            <span class=\"text-lg font-medium text-gray-900\">0.02</span>\n                            <span class=\"text-[0.65rem] font-light text-gray-400\">sec</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"absolute bottom-8 right-10 flex flex-col items-end gap-0.5\">\n                        <span class=\"text-[0.65rem] font-medium text-emerald-500 uppercase tracking-wider\">Real-Time</span>\n                        <span class=\"text-[0.65rem] font-medium text-emerald-500 uppercase tracking-wider\">Latency</span>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Waveform Animation -->\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 h-20 w-48 justify-center\">\n                        <div class=\"wave-bar w-2 bg-gradient-to-t from-emerald-400 to-emerald-300 rounded-full\" style=\"height: 40%;\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"wave-bar w-2 bg-gradient-to-t from-emerald-400 to-emerald-300 rounded-full\" style=\"height: 60%;\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"wave-bar w-2 bg-gradient-to-t from-emerald-400 to-emerald-300 rounded-full\" style=\"height: 100%;\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"wave-bar w-2 bg-gradient-to-t from-emerald-400 to-emerald-300 rounded-full\" style=\"height: 50%;\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"wave-bar w-2 bg-gradient-to-t from-emerald-400 to-emerald-300 rounded-full\" style=\"height: 80%;\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"wave-bar w-2 bg-gradient-to-t from-emerald-400 to-emerald-300 rounded-full\" style=\"height: 30%;\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"wave-bar w-2 bg-gradient-to-t from-emerald-400 to-emerald-300 rounded-full\" style=\"height: 70%;\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"wave-bar w-2 bg-gradient-to-t from-emerald-400 to-emerald-300 rounded-full\" style=\"height: 40%;\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"px-5 pt-4 pb-6 flex-1\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-[1.125rem] font-medium text-gray-900 tracking-tight mb-2\">Ultra-Low Latency</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-[0.875rem] font-light text-gray-500 leading-[1.6]\">Experience zero-latency processing that keeps up with your train of thought, no matter how fast you move.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Card 3: Smart Structuring -->\n            <div class=\"bg-white rounded-3xl p-1.5 shadow-[0_4px_24px_rgba(0,0,0,0.03)] border border-gray-100/60 flex flex-col group hover:shadow-[0_8px_32px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06)] transition-shadow duration-500\">\n                <div class=\"h-[260px] bg-gradient-to-b from-indigo-50/30 to-transparent rounded-[20px] relative flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden\">\n                    \n                    <!-- Document UI -->\n                    <div class=\"w-[200px] bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-[0_12px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.08)] border border-gray-100 p-4 relative overflow-hidden z-10\" style=\"transform: translateY(-10px);\">\n                        <h4 class=\"text-xs font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3 flex items-center gap-1\">Meeting Notes: <span class=\"text-blue-500 font-normal\">Project Alpha</span></h4>\n                        \n                        <div class=\"space-y-2 relative\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-start gap-1.5\">\n                                <div class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-gray-400 mt-1.5\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"h-2 w-24 bg-gray-100 rounded mt-1\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"flex items-start gap-1.5\">\n                                <div class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-gray-400 mt-1.5\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"h-2 w-20 bg-gray-100 rounded mt-1\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"flex items-start gap-1.5 relative z-20\">\n                                <div class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-gray-400 mt-1.5\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"text-[0.6rem] font-light text-gray-600 leading-none\">Need to hire 2 engineers.</div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Scanning highlight line -->\n                        <div id=\"doc-scanner\" class=\"absolute left-0 right-0 h-8 bg-gradient-to-b from-blue-100/0 via-blue-100/40 to-blue-500/20 border-b border-blue-400/40 z-10 pointer-events-none\" style=\"top: 0px;\"></div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Background faint text -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute bottom-8 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 text-[0.55rem] font-light text-gray-300 space-y-1 text-center w-full\">\n                        <p>action items</p>\n                        <p>review design mocks</p>\n                        <p>update marketing copy</p>\n                        <p>schedule team sync</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"px-5 pt-4 pb-6 flex-1\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-[1.125rem] font-medium text-gray-900 tracking-tight mb-2\">Smart Structuring</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-[0.875rem] font-light text-gray-500 leading-[1.6]\">We automatically handle punctuation, capitalization, and formatting so you can focus purely on your ideas.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Card 4: Custom Vocabulary -->\n            <div class=\"bg-white rounded-3xl p-1.5 shadow-[0_4px_24px_rgba(0,0,0,0.03)] border border-gray-100/60 flex flex-col group hover:shadow-[0_8px_32px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06)] transition-shadow duration-500\">\n                <div class=\"h-[260px] bg-gradient-to-b from-orange-50/30 to-transparent rounded-[20px] relative flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden\">\n                    \n                    <!-- Connection SVG -->\n                    <svg class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\">\n                        <defs>\n                            <linearGradient id=\"gradOrange\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"0%\">\n                                <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#fdba74\" stop-opacity=\"0\" />\n                                <stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#f97316\" stop-opacity=\"0.4\" />\n                                <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#fdba74\" stop-opacity=\"0\" />\n                            </linearGradient>\n                        </defs>\n                        <!-- Simulated curved paths -->\n                        <path d=\"M50,50 C30,40 25,35 25,25\" stroke=\"url(#gradOrange)\" stroke-width=\"0.5\" fill=\"none\" />\n                        <path d=\"M50,50 C70,40 75,35 75,25\" stroke=\"url(#gradOrange)\" stroke-width=\"0.5\" fill=\"none\" />\n                        <path d=\"M50,50 C50,70 50,75 50,85\" stroke=\"url(#gradOrange)\" stroke-width=\"0.5\" fill=\"none\" />\n                    </svg>\n\n                    <!-- Nodes -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-10 left-12 bg-white px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full shadow-sm border border-gray-100 flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n                        <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-orange-400\"></div>\n                        <span class=\"text-[0.65rem] font-medium text-gray-700\">Jargon</span>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <div class=\"absolute top-10 right-12 bg-[#1e293b] px-3 py-1 rounded-full shadow-sm border border-gray-800\">\n                        <span class=\"text-[0.65rem] font-medium text-white\">Nickname</span>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"absolute bottom-8 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 bg-white px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full shadow-sm border border-gray-100 flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n                        <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-orange-400\"></div>\n                        <span class=\"text-[0.65rem] font-medium text-gray-700\">Acronym</span>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Central Hub -->\n                    <div class=\"relative w-14 h-14 bg-gradient-to-br from-orange-300 to-orange-500 rounded-[14px] shadow-[0_8px_20px_rgba(249,115,22,0.3)] flex items-center justify-center text-white z-10\" id=\"pulse-hub\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:scanner-linear\" width=\"24\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"px-5 pt-4 pb-6 flex-1\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-[1.125rem] font-medium text-gray-900 tracking-tight mb-2\">Custom Vocabulary</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-[0.875rem] font-light text-gray-500 leading-[1.6]\">Train the engine on your specific industry terms, project acronyms, and team nicknames for perfect accuracy.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Card 5: Enterprise Security -->\n            <div class=\"bg-white rounded-3xl p-1.5 shadow-[0_4px_24px_rgba(0,0,0,0.03)] border border-gray-100/60 flex flex-col group hover:shadow-[0_8px_32px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06)] transition-shadow duration-500\">\n                <div class=\"h-[260px] bg-gradient-to-b from-blue-50/20 to-transparent rounded-[20px] relative flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden perspective-[1000px]\">\n                    \n                    <!-- 3D Floor Ripples -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 mt-12\">\n                        <div class=\"ripple absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-48 h-48 border-[2px] border-blue-100/60 rounded-full\" style=\"transform: rotateX(70deg);\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"ripple absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-32 h-32 border-[2px] border-blue-200/50 rounded-full\" style=\"transform: rotateX(70deg);\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"ripple absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-16 h-16 bg-blue-50/50 rounded-full blur-md\" style=\"transform: rotateX(70deg);\"></div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Floating Shield -->\n                    <div id=\"shield-icon\" class=\"relative z-10 w-20 h-20 flex items-center justify-center bg-gradient-to-b from-blue-400 to-blue-600 text-white rounded-2xl shadow-[0_16px_32px_rgba(59,130,246,0.4)]\" style=\"clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 100% 20%, 100% 70%, 50% 100%, 0% 70%, 0% 20%);\">\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-tr from-transparent via-white/10 to-white/30\"></div>\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:check-read-linear\" width=\"32\" stroke-width=\"2\" class=\"relative z-20\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"px-5 pt-4 pb-6 flex-1\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-[1.125rem] font-medium text-gray-900 tracking-tight mb-2\">Enterprise Security</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-[0.875rem] font-light text-gray-500 leading-[1.6]\">Your data is encrypted end-to-end and never used to train global models. Bank-grade protection built in.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Card 6: Multilingual Support -->\n            <div class=\"bg-white rounded-3xl p-1.5 shadow-[0_4px_24px_rgba(0,0,0,0.03)] border border-gray-100/60 flex flex-col group hover:shadow-[0_8px_32px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06)] transition-shadow duration-500\">\n                <div class=\"h-[260px] bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-[20px] relative flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden\">\n                    \n                    <!-- Keyboard Grid Background -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 grid grid-cols-4 grid-rows-4 gap-2 p-8 opacity-40 pointer-events-none\" style=\"transform: scale(1.2);\">\n                        <!-- Generating empty key shapes -->\n                        <div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100\"></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100\"></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100\"></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100\"></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 opacity-0\"></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100\"></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100\"></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100\"></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100\"></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100\"></div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Active Key -->\n                    <div class=\"relative z-10 w-24 h-24 bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-[0_12px_32px_rgba(0,0,0,0.08)] border border-gray-50 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-3 transform transition-transform duration-300 hover:scale-105\">\n                        <div class=\"w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-red-600 shadow-inner\"></div>\n                        <span class=\"text-[0.65rem] font-light text-gray-400 tracking-widest\">こんにちは</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"px-5 pt-4 pb-6 flex-1\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-[1.125rem] font-medium text-gray-900 tracking-tight mb-2\">Multilingual Support</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-[0.875rem] font-light text-gray-500 leading-[1.6]\">Automatically detect and process over 50 languages with native-level accuracy and contextual understanding.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- Animation Logic mimicking WebGL/Premium smooth interactions -->\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", () => {\n            const start = Date.now();\n            \n            // Elements\n            const orbitRing = document.getElementById('orbit-ring');\n            const orbitIcons = document.querySelectorAll('.orbit-icon');\n            const waves = document.querySelectorAll('.wave-bar');\n            const scanner = document.getElementById('doc-scanner');\n            const shield = document.getElementById('shield-icon');\n            const ripples = document.querySelectorAll('.ripple');\n            const floatTag1 = document.getElementById('float-tag-1');\n            const pulseHub = document.getElementById('pulse-hub');\n            \n            function animate() {\n                const t = (Date.now() - start) / 1000;\n                \n                // 1. Orbits\n                if(orbitRing) {\n                    orbitRing.style.transform = `rotate(${t * 15}deg)`;\n                    orbitIcons.forEach(icon => {\n                        icon.style.transform = `rotate(${-t * 15}deg)`; // keep upright\n                    });\n                }\n                \n                // 2. Waveform\n                waves.forEach((wave, i) => {\n                    // Sine wave calculation for height\n                    const h = 45 + Math.sin(t * 5 + i * 0.8) * 35;\n                    wave.style.height = `${h}%`;\n                });\n                if(floatTag1) {\n                    floatTag1.style.transform = `translateY(${Math.sin(t*2) * 4}px)`;\n                }\n                \n                // 3. Document Scanner\n                if(scanner) {\n                    // Ping-pong scanning effect\n                    const scanPos = (Math.sin(t * 1.5) + 1) / 2 * 60; // 0 to 60px\n                    scanner.style.top = `${scanPos}px`;\n                }\n\n                // 4. Hub Pulse\n                if(pulseHub) {\n                    pulseHub.style.transform = `scale(${1 + Math.sin(t * 3) * 0.02})`;\n                }\n\n                // 5. Shield & Ripples\n                if(shield) {\n                    shield.style.transform = `translateY(${Math.sin(t * 2.5) * 6}px)`;\n                }\n                ripples.forEach((ripple, i) => {\n                    // Expanding ripple logic\n                    const phase = (t * 0.6 - i * 0.4) % 1;\n                    const scale = phase < 0 ? 0 : 0.2 + phase * 1.5;\n                    const opacity = phase < 0 ? 0 : 1 - phase;\n                    ripple.style.transform = `rotateX(70deg) scale(${scale})`;\n                    ripple.style.opacity = opacity * 0.6;\n                });\n\n                requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n            }\n            \n            // Start loop\n            requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "platform-features-4.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/platform-features-4.jpg", "source_name": "platform-features-4-DESIGN.md", "views": 156, "forks": 4, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "5bd6211c-bd4c-467c-b442-4312cac4712c", "created_at": "2026-06-12T07:38:10.793894+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T18:15:17.892792+00:00"}